This is to announce the release of taper 5.0. Below is the LSM
entry and then the major changes in the new version. 

Title:		Taper
Version:  	5.0		
Entered-date:	011095   (DDMMYY)
Description:	This is a tape backup and restore program that provides
		a friendly user interface to allow backing/restoring
		files to a tape drive. Alternatively, files can be backed
		up to archive files. The user interface is similar to 
		Norton Commander and allows traversal of directories, and 
		selection of files easily. SCSI drives are supported as are
		multiple tape archives. Incremental backups & restores
		are handled. Information about all archives made is
 	        stored on the hard disk for easy retrieval about what
	        has been backed up.
Keywords:	Tape, Backup, Archive
